  "title": "IMSEC forms one scaled reciprocal of IMCOS(z) and rejects |re| >= 2^27 or empty text with #NUM!",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0 build 20527, IMSEC(inumber) evaluates z_cos = cos(inumber) (rejecting |re| >= 2^27 and empty text \"\" with #NUM!, while treating a blank cell as 0 -> \"1\") and forms 1 / z_cos as a single scaled reciprocal 1 / (a + b * ratio) multiplied by ratio, with subnormal components flushed to 0. All 1,060 full-bank IMSEC rows match.",
